{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03153","headline":"陪王司马登薛公逍遥台 · 张九龄","name":"陪王司马登薛公逍遥台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻薛公泪，非直雍门琴。\n窜逐留遗迹，悲凉见此心。\n府中因暇豫，江上幸招寻。\n人事已成古，风流独至今。\n闲情多感叹，清景暂登临。\n无复甘棠在，空余蔓草深。\n晴光送远目，胜气入幽襟。\n水去朝沧海，春来换碧林。\n赋怀湘浦吊，碑想汉川沈。\n曾是陪游日，徒爲梁父吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}